              <a href="/p/we-not-sell-your-personal-information" class="footer-link">Do Not Sell My Personal Information</a>
              <span class="footer-sep" id="cookieSettingsSep" hidden>|</span><a href="#" id="cookieSettingsLink" class="footer-link" hidden>Privacy and cookie settings</a>
